    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d142">

                <pb facs="0269" n="157" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg157"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1995</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-09T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 9, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Has so-called eighty million gold yen currency loan been definitely
                    postponed?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
